From e953d3a5d1b217ac4dfef93e558bf72d00e9d030 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:25:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] UML-ANDROID-LOCAL: gpuservice make the gpu_mem tracepoint
 program optional

BPF_EVENTS cannot be enabled on this architecture. It depends on
KPROBE_EVENTS or UPROBE_EVENTS, and arch/um declares neither HAVE_KPROBES nor
ARCH_SUPPORTS_UPROBES, so no tracepoint, kprobe, or perf-event BPF program can
ever load in this guest. Only socket-filter programs load today.

gpuMem.c declared its tracepoint program mandatory, so bpfloader abandoned the
whole object. libmeminfo does not tolerate the resulting absence: BpfMapRO
calls abort() from abortOnMismatch, which killed system_server through

  ReadProcessGpuUsageKb -> android_os_Debug_getGpuTotalUsageKb
  -> MemInfoReader.getGpuKernelUsedSizeKb

The loader creates and pins maps in createMaps before loadCodeSections runs, so
marking the program optional leaves gpu_mem_total_map pinned while the
unloadable program is skipped. libmeminfo then opens a valid empty map and
reports zero GPU memory, which every Java caller already handles because they
test Debug.getGpuTotalUsageKb() >= 0.

Reporting zero is honest here: this product has no kernel GPU memory
accounting to report.

Change-Id: Ibde91dedd1b8108e973263767734e27ea96f4d3b
---
 services/gpuservice/bpfprogs/gpuMem.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/services/gpuservice/bpfprogs/gpuMem.c b/services/gpuservice/bpfprogs/gpuMem.c
index 4a8b100deecb98b3be17c4e5ec18a3f3fc65b292..312054f3c80ec04990b7bd79524e67cbd8a1a5ad 100644
--- a/services/gpuservice/bpfprogs/gpuMem.c
+++ b/services/gpuservice/bpfprogs/gpuMem.c
@@ -52,8 +52,8 @@ struct gpu_mem_total_args {
  * Pass AID_GRAPHICS as gid since gpuservice is in the graphics group.
  * Upon seeing size 0, the corresponding KEY needs to be cleaned up.
  */
-DEFINE_BPF_PROG("tracepoint/gpu_mem/gpu_mem_total", AID_ROOT, AID_GRAPHICS,
-                tracepoint_gpu_mem_gpu_mem_total)
+DEFINE_OPTIONAL_BPF_PROG("tracepoint/gpu_mem/gpu_mem_total", AID_ROOT, AID_GRAPHICS,
+                         tracepoint_gpu_mem_gpu_mem_total)
 (struct gpu_mem_total_args* args) {
     uint64_t key = 0;
     uint64_t cur_val = 0;
